sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Manager Client
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant Z as AuthZ Service
    participant C as ExportController
    participant J as Job/Export Service
    participant MR as Metrics Repository
    participant US as Usage Service
    participant S3 as Object Storage
    participant JR as Job Repository
    participant N as Notification Service
    participant EB as Event Bus

    Note over M,C: Export org/team/user audit data (sessions, scores, usage)\nInputs: scope={org|team|user}, id, from, to, format={csv|parquet}, email

    M->>G: POST /exports/audit {scope,id,from,to,format,email}
    G->>Z: authorize(subject=manager, action=create_export, resource=id)
    alt authorized
        Z-->>G: allow
        G->>C: Forward request
        C->>J: createExportJob(scope,id,from,to,format,email)
        J->>JR: insertJob(status="queued", meta)
        JR-->>J: {jobId}

        C-->>G: 202 Accepted {jobId, status="queued"}
        G-->>M: 202 Accepted {jobId, status="queued"}

        EB-->>J: job.dispatched(jobId)

        %% Worker path
        J->>JR: markRunning(jobId)
        par gather metrics
            J->>MR: fetchMetrics(scope,id,from,to)
            MR-->>J: metricsRows[]
        and gather usage
            J->>US: fetchUsage(scope,id,from,to)
            US-->>J: usageRows[]
        end

        Note over J: join, normalize, add headers and lineage\nchunk -> stream writer

        alt format == "csv"
            J->>S3: putObject(/exports/{jobId}.csv, stream)
            S3-->>J: {url, etag}
        else format == "parquet"
            J->>S3: putObject(/exports/{jobId}.parquet, stream)
            S3-->>J: {url, etag}
        end

        J->>JR: markSucceeded(jobId, {url, etag, rowCount})
        JR-->>J: ok
        J->>EB: publish(job.completed, {jobId, url, rowCount})

        par notify email if provided
            J->>N: sendEmail(email, subject="Audit export ready", link=url)
            N-->>J: emailResult
        and notify webhooks/subscribers
            J->>N: notifyWebhook(event="export.ready", payload={jobId, url})
            N-->>J: webhookResult
        end
    else forbidden
        Z-->>G: deny
        G-->>M: 403 Forbidden
    end

    %% Status polling path
    M->>G: GET /exports/audit/{jobId}/status
    G->>C: Forward status request
    C->>JR: getJob(jobId)
    JR-->>C: {status, url?}
    C-->>G: 200 {status, url?}
    G-->>M: 200 {status, url?}
